# Zoraline, Cosmos Caller: "Whenever Zoraline enters or attacks, you may pay {W}{B} and 2 life. When you do, return target
# nonland permanent card ...". Turn 1 she enters and Bot1 declines; turn 2 Bot2's Soul-Guide Lantern exiles Bot1's Entomb.
# Turn 3 Zoraline attacks (vigilance: she stays untapped) and, a Bat, triggers her own "a Bat you control attacks" too
# (+1 life). Bot1 pays {W}{B} and 2 life and targets the Ornithopter; Bot2 answers by sacrificing the Lantern to exile Bot1's
# graveyard. The target is gone as the reflexive trigger resolves, so it does nothing (CR 608.2b): the payment stays paid.

